    "transliteration": "Ar-Rafi",
    "name_en": "The Exalter",
    "meaning_en": "The Exalter, The One who raises whoever He willed",
    "meaning_ml": "ഉയർത്തുന്നവൻ",
    "audio": "/audio/asma/22.mp3",
    "desc_ml": "സത്യവിശ്വാസികളെയും സൽക്കർമ്മികളെയും പദവികളിൽ ഉയർത്തുന്നവൻ."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "arabic": "ٱلمُعِزُّ",
    "transliteration": "Al-Mu'izz",
    "name_en": "The Bestower of Honors",
    "meaning_en": "He gives esteem to whoever He willed",
